# BlueprintAI makes no external API calls: floor plans are measured on-device via AR
# tap-to-trace (src/lib/ar-capture.ts) and rendered/exported locally. No API keys needed.
#
# The only "provider" is the local mock (sample plans for UI development, always labeled
# "Mock mode" in the UI). A self-hosted photo-assist provider may be added later per
# docs/research/floorplan-no-external-api-plan.md (Phase 2) — it would plug into
# src/lib/ai-provider.ts without touching the rest of the app.
